B.aGz=new A.n("street","[Set 31] I speak without a mouth on every corner; ignore me and pay a fine. What am I?","A traffic sign")
B.aNY=new A.n("street","Deep riddle #942 \u2014 I change color but never mood; red stops, green releases. What am I?","A stoplight")
B.aKC=new A.n("street","[Set 31] Rolling on four yet carrying hundreds; I stop every block but never walk. What am I?","A city bus")
B.aPw=new A.n("street","[Set 31] I am tagged in spray paint yet tell stories the city tries to erase. What am I?","Graffiti")
B.aJ8=new A.n("street","Challenge 945: Sold from a window with no door; hunger knows my bell. What am I? (Think carefully.)","A food truck")
B.aHh=new A.n("church","[Set 31] I rise toward heaven yet stand on earth; bells call the faithful to me. What am I?","A steeple")
B.aTX=new A.n("church","[Set 31] Passed hand to hand yet never owned; peace lives in my circle. What am I?","The sign of peace")
B.aU8=new A.n("church","Deep riddle #948 \u2014 I am bread and wine yet become something greater in belief. What am I?","Communion")
B.aKs=new A.n("church","[Set 31] Whispered on knees, answered in seasons; I move mountains slowly. What am I?","Prayer")
B.aPG=new A.n("church","Challenge 950: I have no voice but every hymn passes through me. What am I?","A choir loft")
B.aU_=new A.n("logic","Deep riddle #951 \u2014 The more you take from me, the larger I become. What am I?","A hole")
B.aLJ=new A.n("logic","[Set 31] I have cities but no houses, forests but no trees, water but no fish. What am I? (Think carefully.)","A map")
B.aJN=new A.n("logic","[Set 31] I speak without a mouth and hear without ears; I have no body but come alive with wind. What am I?","An echo")
B.aJ0=new A.n("logic","Deep riddle #954 \u2014 Born tall, I die short; every word I carry shrinks me. What am I?","A candle")
B.aS1=new A.n("logic","Challenge 955: I have keys but open no locks; space but no room; enter but not go inside. What am I?","A keyboard")
B.aGw=new A.n("nature","[Set 31] I fall but never get hurt; I blanket the world in white silence. What am I?","Snow")
B.aJd=new A.n("nature","Deep riddle #957 \u2014 I have no lungs yet I hold every breath of the forest. What am I?","A tree")
B.aMn=new A.n("mystery","[Set 31] I am seen in mirrors yet never in the same room twice. What am I?","Your reflection leaving")
B.aNu=new A.n("mystery","[Set 31] Doors open for me though I carry no key; time is my ally. What am I? (Think carefully.)","A habit")
B.aO3=new A.n("wordplay","Challenge 960: What word becomes shorter when you add two letters to it?","Short (adding -er)")
B.aNK=new A.n("logic","Logic puzzle #992: a number times itself minus 82 equals 7314. What is the number?","86")
B.aUf=new A.n("love","[Set 32] I have a heart that never beats yet lovers chase me across centuries. What am I?","A love letter")
